(1560098, 207674, 92, '<td valign="top">The beautiful sun washed color is perfect. The angle/composition is superb. The rainbow is that finishing touch that has the viewer staring in awe. LOVE it !</td>', 'The beautiful sun washed color is perfect. The angle/composition is superb. The rainbow is that finishing touch that has the viewer staring in awe. LOVE it !', '2005-07-25 01:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
