(1560107, 206917, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice rural setting. I like the reflection. I wish the image were a tad larger. The composition and coloration is very pleasing.</td>', 'Nice rural setting. I like the reflection. I wish the image were a tad larger. The composition and coloration is very pleasing.', '2005-07-25 01:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560109, 207674, 25464, '<td valign="top">I love these types of shots.  I think this one could use a little sky darkening around the top edge to hold the shot together but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'I love these types of shots.  I think this one could use a little sky darkening around the top edge to hold the shot together but otherwise very nice.', '2005-07-25 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560114, 208300, 35444, '<td valign="top">How''dya get that wheel to go round?</td>', 'How''dya get that wheel to go round?', '2005-07-25 01:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560116, 208492, 15711, '<td valign="top">The focal point is slightly out of focus. I wish it were more crisp and perhaps closer zoomed so we could see the details of the record.</td>', 'The focal point is slightly out of focus. I wish it were more crisp and perhaps closer zoomed so we could see the details of the record.', '2005-07-25 01:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560117, 208596, 37234, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m a sucker for B&amp;W, and I really like this one. I do think the light is a bit harsh, but it''s not a big detraction. I vote 8.</td>', 'Well, I''m a sucker for B&W, and I really like this one. I do think the light is a bit harsh, but it''s not a big detraction. I vote 8.', '2005-07-25 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560120, 206859, 15711, '<td valign="top">The statue is way too dark to see any detail. The tree is a touch distracting. Maybe shoot it with better lighting from a different angle, so it stands alone.</td>', 'The statue is way too dark to see any detail. The tree is a touch distracting. Maybe shoot it with better lighting from a different angle, so it stands alone.', '2005-07-25 01:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560121, 207791, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think I would have bumped the saturation up a bit to warm it up, but I really like the composition.  It is thought provoking.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think I would have bumped the saturation up a bit to warm it up, but I really like the composition.  It is thought provoking.', '2005-07-25 01:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560128, 208507, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting coming from the left.  I wish the Tiki were shot from an angle instead of just straight on - it might make for some interesting shadows and detail.</td>', 'I like the lighting coming from the left.  I wish the Tiki were shot from an angle instead of just straight on - it might make for some interesting shadows and detail.', '2005-07-25 01:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560131, 207677, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever! I get it.  hee hee</td>', 'Clever! I get it.  hee hee', '2005-07-25 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560140, 207751, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro. Unusual take. I love your imagination and the contrast between the yellow of the wood and the blue of the background.  Also the cool of the gray/black springs and the warm of the wood.  Really good.</td>', 'Very nice macro. Unusual take. I love your imagination and the contrast between the yellow of the wood and the blue of the background.  Also the cool of the gray/black springs and the warm of the wood.  Really good.', '2005-07-25 01:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560143, 208028, 15811, '<td valign="top">Very good contrast here -- Although some may find it a bit dark, I personally like it.   The composition could be a bit better, however...unless the focus is on the wheel, but I think you could have gotten a shot of the whole thing.</td>', 'Very good contrast here -- Although some may find it a bit dark, I personally like it.   The composition could be a bit better, however...unless the focus is on the wheel, but I think you could have gotten a shot of the whole thing.', '2005-07-25 01:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560144, 208447, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think the only thing wrong here is possibly the time of day.  It is a bit bright.  It also might be improved to move the shot up a bit to include a bit less grass and more sky.  The shoreline is cutting the frame in half which is almost never a good thing.  It has potential, interest, and great rich color.  Just needs some fine tuning.</td>', 'I think the only thing wrong here is possibly the time of day.  It is a bit bright.  It also might be improved to move the shot up a bit to include a bit less grass and more sky.  The shoreline is cutting the frame in half which is almost never a good thing.  It has potential, interest, and great rich color.  Just needs some fine tuning.', '2005-07-25 01:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560147, 208659, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Intersting subject and nice setup, but it just doesn''t strike any strong feeling in my one way or the other. There is one spot on the mask that is blown out that should have been toned down a bit.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Intersting subject and nice setup, but it just doesn''t strike any strong feeling in my one way or the other. There is one spot on the mask that is blown out that should have been toned down a bit.', '2005-07-25 01:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560151, 206168, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish the metal part were sharper. They are a tad "hot" as well. Maybe tone down the glare on them. The linear quality is interesting.</td>', 'I wish the metal part were sharper. They are a tad "hot" as well. Maybe tone down the glare on them. The linear quality is interesting.', '2005-07-25 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560153, 208421, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...good concept, I like the composition -- it looks good with the boots to the far side.  The lighting is rather interesting.</td>', 'hrmm...good concept, I like the composition -- it looks good with the boots to the far side.  The lighting is rather interesting.', '2005-07-25 01:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560156, 206266, 30791, '<td valign="top">i love taking pictures in golden hour you get such awesome results<br/>8 from me</td>', 'i love taking pictures in golden hour you get such awesome results8 from me', '2005-07-25 01:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560159, 208518, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great old shack. I like how you saturated the color.  Evokes a mood. I like the shadows and light. On suggestion - shoot it from a different angle so it''s not so dead center.</td>', 'Great old shack. I like how you saturated the color.  Evokes a mood. I like the shadows and light. On suggestion - shoot it from a different angle so it''s not so dead center.', '2005-07-25 01:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560160, 208421, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Very nice photo. Excellent use of lighting and extras (boots) to make the normal staircase very interesting. Great job!</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Very nice photo. Excellent use of lighting and extras (boots) to make the normal staircase very interesting. Great job!', '2005-07-25 01:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560161, 208015, 25464, '<td valign="top">The color is very flat here.  I don''t know if that is what you were going for, but I think it either needs to be black and white, sepia, or much richer color to work.  The barn is interesting, but might be more interesting with a bit looser crop.  It seems a little crowded.  The detail in the grass/wheat is nice.</td>', 'The color is very flat here.  I don''t know if that is what you were going for, but I think it either needs to be black and white, sepia, or much richer color to work.  The barn is interesting, but might be more interesting with a bit looser crop.  It seems a little crowded.  The detail in the grass/wheat is nice.', '2005-07-25 01:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560162, 208033, 34878, '<td valign="top">very funny photo!!  Hope woody saves me someday!!</td>', 'very funny photo!!  Hope woody saves me someday!!', '2005-07-25 01:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560164, 206665, 37234, '<td valign="top">This is a thinker of an image. It really made me pause and wonder about the story behind it. I vote 7.</td>', 'This is a thinker of an image. It really made me pause and wonder about the story behind it. I vote 7.', '2005-07-25 01:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560167, 208427, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and color. I wish the buildings were a touch more sharp. The overall composition is nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and color. I wish the buildings were a touch more sharp. The overall composition is nicely done.', '2005-07-25 01:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560173, 207619, 25397, '<td valign="top">Just brillaint! <br/>I love that title ;-)</td>', 'Just brillaint! I love that title ;-)', '2005-07-25 01:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560174, 208651, 15811, '<td valign="top">Yes, the building and the bench are wooden, the light is interesting as well, coming in the window.  Think about composition when you''re out...look through the camera, see the image as it will appear on a print or on the computer screen.  Look left, right, etc...  It seems like an interesting place though...but like I said, think about composition.</td>', 'Yes, the building and the bench are wooden, the light is interesting as well, coming in the window.  Think about composition when you''re out...look through the camera, see the image as it will appear on a print or on the computer screen.  Look left, right, etc...  It seems like an interesting place though...but like I said, think about composition.', '2005-07-25 01:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560175, 208619, 92, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast and composition !!!!!!!!!!  Superb eye for this one ! 10</td>', 'Wonderful contrast and composition !!!!!!!!!!  Superb eye for this one ! 10', '2005-07-25 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560177, 207849, 37234, '<td valign="top">I suspect someone will complain about the angle, but I like it. I like your choice of colorization, as well. I do think the image could use a bit more sharpening all around, but it''s not a huge detractor. I vote 7.</td>', 'I suspect someone will complain about the angle, but I like it. I like your choice of colorization, as well. I do think the image could use a bit more sharpening all around, but it''s not a huge detractor. I vote 7.', '2005-07-25 01:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560180, 205728, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting subject, but I am not sure about the composition.  I think you would need to start with all of the first bucket showing, or just the base of the first bucket.  The missing handle in the shot, as is, is distracting.</td>', 'This is a very interesting subject, but I am not sure about the composition.  I think you would need to start with all of the first bucket showing, or just the base of the first bucket.  The missing handle in the shot, as is, is distracting.', '2005-07-25 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
