(1560218, 208676, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition with nice detail.  The contrast could be bumped up just a tad for more true blacks and whites, but some thought went into this one.  I could see this being a successful stock image.  It could be associated with loneliness, emptiness, winter, etc.  Many uses.</td>', 'This is a great composition with nice detail.  The contrast could be bumped up just a tad for more true blacks and whites, but some thought went into this one.  I could see this being a successful stock image.  It could be associated with loneliness, emptiness, winter, etc.  Many uses.', '2005-07-25 01:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560221, 207607, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich color with lots of contrast and textures. This is beautiful !</td>', 'Beautiful rich color with lots of contrast and textures. This is beautiful !', '2005-07-25 01:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
