(1560635, 208387, 3669, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this image pop up on my screen, I wanted to rotate the picture 90 degrees to the left because I thought I was seeing 3 seperate trees.  Then I saw the bricks and got orientated.  Perhaps taking the picture more to the right to include at least part of the trunk of the large tree would have helped the confusion.</td>', 'When I first saw this image pop up on my screen, I wanted to rotate the picture 90 degrees to the left because I thought I was seeing 3 seperate trees.  Then I saw the bricks and got orientated.  Perhaps taking the picture more to the right to include at least part of the trunk of the large tree would have helped the confusion.', '2005-07-25 03:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
