(1560660, 208619, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this picture and the dreamy"ness" of it.  The left side of the picture is neat with the walkway disappearing behind the little wooden shed.  The right side, however, is dark and cluttered.  I would have liked to see the right side cropped out because I feel it doesn''t positively add to the shot.  6</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this picture and the dreamy"ness" of it.  The left side of the picture is neat with the walkway disappearing behind the little wooden shed.  The right side, however, is dark and cluttered.  I would have liked to see the right side cropped out because I feel it doesn''t positively add to the shot.  6', '2005-07-25 03:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560665, 208558, 3669, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and very creative.  I like the composition with the scraps and sawdust around the DPC ribbon.  The wood grain shows up well.  I just do not care for the lighting much, especially at the bottom of the picture.  7</td>', 'Cute idea and very creative.  I like the composition with the scraps and sawdust around the DPC ribbon.  The wood grain shows up well.  I just do not care for the lighting much, especially at the bottom of the picture.  7', '2005-07-25 03:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
