(1560723, 208654, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is one of the breast pictures in the challenge.  (I kill me)  It does have great detail and I love the coloring.  The iron fence and archway in the background give this place the charm of a garden courtyard.  I picture fountains and statues throughout the grounds.  The wooden breast is unlike any of the stone figures I picture here.  It is indeed "Au Natural."   9</td>', 'This is one of the breast pictures in the challenge.  (I kill me)  It does have great detail and I love the coloring.  The iron fence and archway in the background give this place the charm of a garden courtyard.  I picture fountains and statues throughout the grounds.  The wooden breast is unlike any of the stone figures I picture here.  It is indeed "Au Natural."   9', '2005-07-25 04:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560724, 208597, 3669, '<td valign="top">Would have like to have seen this in sharper focus.</td>', 'Would have like to have seen this in sharper focus.', '2005-07-25 04:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
