(1561056, 207372, 36981, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail!  This is terrific - I''m eager to see what lens you used so that I can be jealous!</td>', 'Incredible detail!  This is terrific - I''m eager to see what lens you used so that I can be jealous!', '2005-07-25 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561057, 208491, 33182, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like the focus where it is. I think I''d prefer it if the whole thing was in focus.</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like the focus where it is. I think I''d prefer it if the whole thing was in focus.', '2005-07-25 09:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561058, 208157, 33182, '<td valign="top">Is this naturally this orange? It doesn''t appear naturally.</td>', 'Is this naturally this orange? It doesn''t appear naturally.', '2005-07-25 09:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561059, 207046, 36981, '<td valign="top">Beaufiful image!  I love the detail in the wood in the foreground, and the short depth of field.  Perfect model &amp; clothing for this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Beaufiful image!  I love the detail in the wood in the foreground, and the short depth of field.  Perfect model & clothing for this shot.  Well done.', '2005-07-25 09:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561062, 208449, 33182, '<td valign="top">Too me the subject of the picture is the bird and not the wood. Don''t feel too bad though since I think I''m going to get dinged for the same thing (except I didn''t use a bird).</td>', 'Too me the subject of the picture is the bird and not the wood. Don''t feel too bad though since I think I''m going to get dinged for the same thing (except I didn''t use a bird).', '2005-07-25 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561065, 207677, 33182, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the shallow DOF and the shadow of the knight in the background.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the shallow DOF and the shadow of the knight in the background.', '2005-07-25 09:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561067, 208517, 33182, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have liked this more if it was completely in focus and turned just a little to get a better sense of the length. I could be wrong about that last part though.</td>', 'I think I''d have liked this more if it was completely in focus and turned just a little to get a better sense of the length. I could be wrong about that last part though.', '2005-07-25 09:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561071, 207060, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is it glued together?? Interesting.<br/> <br/>I think I might have shot this from a different angle.  Since it is natural materials it kind of gets lost amidst all the trees and the grasses. Maybe a sideways shot could have worked better. Maybe a tighter crop to concentrate on the horse and not the surroundings.</td>', 'Is it glued together?? Interesting. I think I might have shot this from a different angle.  Since it is natural materials it kind of gets lost amidst all the trees and the grasses. Maybe a sideways shot could have worked better. Maybe a tighter crop to concentrate on the horse and not the surroundings.', '2005-07-25 09:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561073, 208463, 15711, '<td valign="top">I notice that you''ve placed the pole dead center in the photo.  It might have been more interesting to either shoot a macro and concentrate on the texture of the bark, or perhaps shot it from an angle, taking advantage of negative space to make the overall picture more visually appealing.</td>', 'I notice that you''ve placed the pole dead center in the photo.  It might have been more interesting to either shoot a macro and concentrate on the texture of the bark, or perhaps shot it from an angle, taking advantage of negative space to make the overall picture more visually appealing.', '2005-07-25 09:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561075, 206616, 36981, '<td valign="top">V funny!  and very well done.  Thanks!</td>', 'V funny!  and very well done.  Thanks!', '2005-07-25 09:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561076, 207379, 15711, '<td valign="top">With the cross cropped as it is, it looks almost like an X instead of a true cross.  Maybe pan back just a tad. The similar colors of the portrait and the wood are complimentary and the lines of the document run parallel with the cross piece, creating an interesting parallel effect.</td>', 'With the cross cropped as it is, it looks almost like an X instead of a true cross.  Maybe pan back just a tad. The similar colors of the portrait and the wood are complimentary and the lines of the document run parallel with the cross piece, creating an interesting parallel effect.', '2005-07-25 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561078, 208462, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast. I like the vine adding a natural touch to this photo.  Good composition</td>', 'Nice contrast. I like the vine adding a natural touch to this photo.  Good composition', '2005-07-25 09:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561080, 208526, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a fun colorful photograph. Shooting on white works here. I like the helter skelter arrangement of the blocks - it gives the eye lots of visual candy.  Maybe not quite as close a crop for my taste.</td>', 'This is a fun colorful photograph. Shooting on white works here. I like the helter skelter arrangement of the blocks - it gives the eye lots of visual candy.  Maybe not quite as close a crop for my taste.', '2005-07-25 09:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561081, 208677, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nice, until now I never really thought of cinnamon as wood though. It is, I just never really thought of it.</td>', 'Nice, until now I never really thought of cinnamon as wood though. It is, I just never really thought of it.', '2005-07-25 09:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561082, 207060, 33182, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2005-07-25 09:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561083, 206917, 33182, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice colors.', '2005-07-25 09:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561084, 208454, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lots of varied wood applications and similar coloration makes for a nice monochromatic theme. I like the off placement of the chair. This might''ve been fun in black and white with lots of contrast - just a thought.  I wish the image were larger so we could see the details of the planks better.</td>', 'Lots of varied wood applications and similar coloration makes for a nice monochromatic theme. I like the off placement of the chair. This might''ve been fun in black and white with lots of contrast - just a thought.  I wish the image were larger so we could see the details of the planks better.', '2005-07-25 09:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561086, 208233, 33182, '<td valign="top">I think it could use a little bit of fill lighting, but not much. I like it in shadow, just wish I could see more end pieces.</td>', 'I think it could use a little bit of fill lighting, but not much. I like it in shadow, just wish I could see more end pieces.', '2005-07-25 09:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561087, 208672, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but you can''t really see any wood. Maybe a hint in the lines in the water, but that''s all</td>', 'Nice capture, but you can''t really see any wood. Maybe a hint in the lines in the water, but that''s all', '2005-07-25 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561088, 208421, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this. The varations of the warm tones in the stairs compliment the dark browns of the boots.  The lighting is interesting. I wish it were a larger image so we could really hone in on the details and knotholes.</td>', 'I like the composition of this. The varations of the warm tones in the stairs compliment the dark browns of the boots.  The lighting is interesting. I wish it were a larger image so we could really hone in on the details and knotholes.', '2005-07-25 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561090, 208670, 33182, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I really think the perspective makes this picture great.</td>', 'Very cool. I really think the perspective makes this picture great.', '2005-07-25 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561091, 207670, 15711, '<td valign="top">This might have more visual appeal if not so tightly cropped and the wagon weren''t dead center in the photograph. I like the angle of the shot and the sky color.</td>', 'This might have more visual appeal if not so tightly cropped and the wagon weren''t dead center in the photograph. I like the angle of the shot and the sky color.', '2005-07-25 09:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561092, 206709, 33182, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the lighting. It''s not bad, I just can''t make up my mind if I like the shadow at the top and bottom.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the lighting. It''s not bad, I just can''t make up my mind if I like the shadow at the top and bottom.', '2005-07-25 09:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561094, 208033, 33182, '<td valign="top">LOL. Love the concept.</td>', 'LOL. Love the concept.', '2005-07-25 09:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561096, 208632, 33182, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the softness of the picture.</td>', 'Very cool. I love the softness of the picture.', '2005-07-25 09:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561097, 208546, 15711, '<td valign="top">This might have a bit more pop if the instument were placed on a solid black background with some lighting coming from a single source to one side.  I like the variations in the woodgrain and the different colors of the wood. As it is just in the center of the shot, it doesn''t have an overall interesting quality. I hope this helps.</td>', 'This might have a bit more pop if the instument were placed on a solid black background with some lighting coming from a single source to one side.  I like the variations in the woodgrain and the different colors of the wood. As it is just in the center of the shot, it doesn''t have an overall interesting quality. I hope this helps.', '2005-07-25 09:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561099, 208674, 33182, '<td valign="top">I know this is a "wood" challenge, but I think the people just make this picture shine.</td>', 'I know this is a "wood" challenge, but I think the people just make this picture shine.', '2005-07-25 09:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561102, 208551, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I''d concentrate on one horse and zoom in or do a macro of his head. As it is, it seems a bit busy. With so much vivid blue, it casts a blue hue throughout the photo. Maybe bring up the red saturation a tad?  I hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I think I''d concentrate on one horse and zoom in or do a macro of his head. As it is, it seems a bit busy. With so much vivid blue, it casts a blue hue throughout the photo. Maybe bring up the red saturation a tad?  I hope this is helpful.', '2005-07-25 09:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561103, 208608, 33182, '<td valign="top">Ack. I bet it was fun putting back together. &lt;g&gt; I like the shadows, but wish they were a tad, and I mean just a tad, lighter.</td>', 'Ack. I bet it was fun putting back together. <g> I like the shadows, but wish they were a tad, and I mean just a tad, lighter.', '2005-07-25 09:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561104, 208597, 33182, '<td valign="top">Could use a little bit of sharpening.</td>', 'Could use a little bit of sharpening.', '2005-07-25 09:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561105, 207914, 33182, '<td valign="top">Could use a little bit more fill light.</td>', 'Could use a little bit more fill light.', '2005-07-25 09:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561108, 208499, 15711, '<td valign="top">This might really have some punch in black and white. There isn''t alot of contrast as it is and no real focal point. I like the idea of the moss - maybe do a macro with lots of detail and perhaps one of the leaves peeking into the shot. I hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'This might really have some punch in black and white. There isn''t alot of contrast as it is and no real focal point. I like the idea of the moss - maybe do a macro with lots of detail and perhaps one of the leaves peeking into the shot. I hope you find this helpful.', '2005-07-25 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561110, 206295, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  I think I might desat a bit of the red and perhaps the yellow of the wood. It might be really interesting done in black and white. The dark background is effectibe but I think the light just makes it t tad too yellow. I like how it skims over the left edges and the "S" is very vivid.</td>', 'Nice macro.  I think I might desat a bit of the red and perhaps the yellow of the wood. It might be really interesting done in black and white. The dark background is effectibe but I think the light just makes it t tad too yellow. I like how it skims over the left edges and the "S" is very vivid.', '2005-07-25 09:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561111, 208081, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful water.  This might have more visual interesting if the boat weren''t dead center in the shot.  Maybe off to one side would make it more appealing. The lighting and depth of color is done well.</td>', 'Beautiful water.  This might have more visual interesting if the boat weren''t dead center in the shot.  Maybe off to one side would make it more appealing. The lighting and depth of color is done well.', '2005-07-25 09:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561112, 207995, 33182, '<td valign="top">The photo could be larger. Use can post a picture with the long end peing 640 pixels, your long side is only 450. It''s a nice picture though.</td>', 'The photo could be larger. Use can post a picture with the long end peing 640 pixels, your long side is only 450. It''s a nice picture though.', '2005-07-25 09:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561115, 206144, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but I''m not sure I care for the concept.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but I''m not sure I care for the concept.', '2005-07-25 09:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561118, 208447, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I find the colors very appealing. I like the rusty roof against the green and blue of the natural land/seascape. I wish the front of the house weren''t in shadow, but perhaps that gives it more appeal. Nice.</td>', 'Nice composition. I find the colors very appealing. I like the rusty roof against the green and blue of the natural land/seascape. I wish the front of the house weren''t in shadow, but perhaps that gives it more appeal. Nice.', '2005-07-25 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561119, 207371, 33182, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The lighting is great.</td>', 'I really like this one. The lighting is great.', '2005-07-25 09:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561121, 208407, 33182, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the nail and the knot in the wood.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the nail and the knot in the wood.', '2005-07-25 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561124, 206854, 15711, '<td valign="top">This might be more interesting if in focus and the sky not be so overexposed.  Perhaps shoot it at a different time of day.</td>', 'This might be more interesting if in focus and the sky not be so overexposed.  Perhaps shoot it at a different time of day.', '2005-07-25 09:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561125, 208659, 33182, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Too bad my eyes keep getting drawn to the "sun" instead of the face.</td>', 'Very cool. Too bad my eyes keep getting drawn to the "sun" instead of the face.', '2005-07-25 09:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561128, 208015, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like how the light is even and isn''t too harsh.</td>', 'Nice. I like how the light is even and isn''t too harsh.', '2005-07-25 09:51:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1561132, 208322, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this. Is it Brighton Bay? Great contrasting colors and the ladders add to the overall appeal.  The triangles of the roofs are a fun contrast to the squares and rectangles of the wall.  I like this alot.</td>', 'I love this. Is it Brighton Bay? Great contrasting colors and the ladders add to the overall appeal.  The triangles of the roofs are a fun contrast to the squares and rectangles of the wall.  I like this alot.', '2005-07-25 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561133, 208429, 33182, '<td valign="top">The squares are freaking out my eyes, they don''t know where to look. I really like the picutre, and I think it''s because of that.</td>', 'The squares are freaking out my eyes, they don''t know where to look. I really like the picutre, and I think it''s because of that.', '2005-07-25 09:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561136, 208434, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with some negative space. Oood use of black and white. I like that one ship has dark sales and the other has light - this makes for nice contrast.</td>', 'Nice composition with some negative space. Oood use of black and white. I like that one ship has dark sales and the other has light - this makes for nice contrast.', '2005-07-25 09:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561138, 207612, 33182, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the dog. It adds something to the picture without distracting from the wooden fence.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the dog. It adds something to the picture without distracting from the wooden fence.', '2005-07-25 09:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561139, 208686, 15711, '<td valign="top">With it being in shadow, I can''t really tell what it is. The background is almost more interesting than the subject. Maybe shoot in different light??</td>', 'With it being in shadow, I can''t really tell what it is. The background is almost more interesting than the subject. Maybe shoot in different light??', '2005-07-25 09:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561141, 208427, 33182, '<td valign="top">Not sure where the focus is on this one. I really like the colors and how it looks like it''s all alone in the world.</td>', 'Not sure where the focus is on this one. I really like the colors and how it looks like it''s all alone in the world.', '2005-07-25 09:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561144, 208624, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool. This is the most artistic shot I''ve seen yet in this challenge. It offers lots of visual candy, without going overboard (no pun intended). I like the grays/blues of the sky and building aganst the warm tones of the wood. The square geometric shapes of the skyscrapers juxtaposed amidst the curve of the walkway is very appealing.</td>', 'Very cool. This is the most artistic shot I''ve seen yet in this challenge. It offers lots of visual candy, without going overboard (no pun intended). I like the grays/blues of the sky and building aganst the warm tones of the wood. The square geometric shapes of the skyscrapers juxtaposed amidst the curve of the walkway is very appealing.', '2005-07-25 09:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561145, 206274, 33182, '<td valign="top">oh wow. I really like this one. Only negative I have is the hot spot on the far right of the top piece.</td>', 'oh wow. I really like this one. Only negative I have is the hot spot on the far right of the top piece.', '2005-07-25 09:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561146, 207998, 33182, '<td valign="top">I know you say it''s dusk, but still seems too dark, buy just a little.</td>', 'I know you say it''s dusk, but still seems too dark, buy just a little.', '2005-07-25 09:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561148, 208682, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I would have shot it from an angle so that you aren''t looking at it straight on. The overall capture is just a tad dull.  Maybe it was a cloudy day. Or try it in black and white and play with the contrast for a bit more visual interest.  What if you zoomed in and concentrated on part of the barn and the detail of the wood? I hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I think I would have shot it from an angle so that you aren''t looking at it straight on. The overall capture is just a tad dull.  Maybe it was a cloudy day. Or try it in black and white and play with the contrast for a bit more visual interest.  What if you zoomed in and concentrated on part of the barn and the detail of the wood? I hope this is helpful.', '2005-07-25 09:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561150, 206790, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the sky. Maybe crop out some of the dirt in the foreground as it doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  I''d shoot it from an angle so the pole isn''t dead center.  Or zoom in and just concentrate on part of it to show off the details.</td>', 'I love the sky. Maybe crop out some of the dirt in the foreground as it doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  I''d shoot it from an angle so the pole isn''t dead center.  Or zoom in and just concentrate on part of it to show off the details.', '2005-07-25 09:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561151, 207607, 31443, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint, can see the boards and bolts clearly...</td>', 'Great viewpoint, can see the boards and bolts clearly...', '2005-07-25 10:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561152, 206115, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadow and light. Is that a planer at the end? I like your use of negative space as well.</td>', 'Nice use of shadow and light. Is that a planer at the end? I like your use of negative space as well.', '2005-07-25 10:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561153, 208439, 40386, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, the only thing I would change is to crop the picture so the bright spot in the bottom right is taken out.  I find it distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, the only thing I would change is to crop the picture so the bright spot in the bottom right is taken out.  I find it distracting.', '2005-07-25 10:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561154, 208619, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s always a fine balance to be struck in the processing of such images - to maintain the feel of the photographic, and yet to approach the painterly. I think you get pretty close to that line, and yet remain on the right side of it. The vignetting is perhaps a touch strong, yet believable. Technical processing is good - great sense of detail and texture.</td>', 'There''s always a fine balance to be struck in the processing of such images - to maintain the feel of the photographic, and yet to approach the painterly. I think you get pretty close to that line, and yet remain on the right side of it. The vignetting is perhaps a touch strong, yet believable. Technical processing is good - great sense of detail and texture.', '2005-07-25 10:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561156, 208651, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love the warmth of the tones in this.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the warmth of the tones in this.  Well done!', '2005-07-25 10:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561158, 207774, 36981, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Really well composed, great subject and wonderful effects.</td>', 'Excellent!  Really well composed, great subject and wonderful effects.', '2005-07-25 10:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561160, 208672, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great shot. WOW - is it ever clear. My one critique might be to move it off of the center and have it a little to one side.  I love the droplets at the top!</td>', 'Great shot. WOW - is it ever clear. My one critique might be to move it off of the center and have it a little to one side.  I love the droplets at the top!', '2005-07-25 10:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561161, 206859, 40386, '<td valign="top">Very underexposed.  A bit of fill flash or increase in brightness would give this shot more impact.</td>', 'Very underexposed.  A bit of fill flash or increase in brightness would give this shot more impact.', '2005-07-25 10:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561164, 207011, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll do better with a larger size image and closer relevance to the challenge.</td>', 'I think you''ll do better with a larger size image and closer relevance to the challenge.', '2005-07-25 10:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561166, 208124, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great use of sepia.  Maybe shoot it from the side for a bit more visual interest. I like the old wooden fence with it''s uneven posts.  That object to the right  (Chiminea?) doesn''t add anything to the photo so you could even crop it out, and you might miss some of the cabin, but it would still be a nice shot.</td>', 'Great use of sepia.  Maybe shoot it from the side for a bit more visual interest. I like the old wooden fence with it''s uneven posts.  That object to the right  (Chiminea?) doesn''t add anything to the photo so you could even crop it out, and you might miss some of the cabin, but it would still be a nice shot.', '2005-07-25 10:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561167, 207980, 36981, '<td valign="top">This could be a good entry; I like the subject.  More contrast &amp; more interesting lighting would help here.</td>', 'This could be a good entry; I like the subject.  More contrast & more interesting lighting would help here.', '2005-07-25 10:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561168, 208560, 16241, '<td valign="top">great idea!   ribbon</td>', 'great idea!   ribbon', '2005-07-25 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561169, 207791, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I like the soft light and colors.  Nice shadowing as well.</td>', 'Lovely. I like the soft light and colors.  Nice shadowing as well.', '2005-07-25 10:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561172, 208049, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think this is a little out of focus, and it seems slightly overexposed (especially "hot spots" like on the dolls'' foreheads.</td>', 'I think this is a little out of focus, and it seems slightly overexposed (especially "hot spots" like on the dolls'' foreheads.', '2005-07-25 10:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561173, 208673, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sequoia?   Maybe remove some of the foreground - the dirt doesn''t add anything.  I might desat the blue a tad. This has nice perspective and the human amidst that huge tree is interesting to the eye.</td>', 'Sequoia?   Maybe remove some of the foreground - the dirt doesn''t add anything.  I might desat the blue a tad. This has nice perspective and the human amidst that huge tree is interesting to the eye.', '2005-07-25 10:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561175, 206345, 6999, '<td valign="top">edit<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-01 11:54:19.</i></td>', 'edit', '2005-07-25 10:05:16.000000', '2005-08-01 12:54:19.000000', 1),
(1561177, 208491, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I''d pan back a bit so you could see more of the metronome.  Or maybe crop out the brass ring on the right and show more of the other aspects of it. I find that ring a tad distracting. You did shoot it from a good angle though - not straight on. I hope this helps.</td>', 'I think I''d pan back a bit so you could see more of the metronome.  Or maybe crop out the brass ring on the right and show more of the other aspects of it. I find that ring a tad distracting. You did shoot it from a good angle though - not straight on. I hope this helps.', '2005-07-25 10:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561180, 208304, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has nice lighting.  I wish the squirrel weren''t so centered. Maybe follow down the wooden plank with him at the end for a bit more visual interest, or just less of a crop on one side.  I like the twinkle in his eye. hee hee Good DOF.  THe gray/blue of the wood is a nice contrast to his warm brown and yellow tones.  Overall,  nice capture. 7</td>', 'This has nice lighting.  I wish the squirrel weren''t so centered. Maybe follow down the wooden plank with him at the end for a bit more visual interest, or just less of a crop on one side.  I like the twinkle in his eye. hee hee Good DOF.  THe gray/blue of the wood is a nice contrast to his warm brown and yellow tones.  Overall,  nice capture. 7', '2005-07-25 10:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
