(1561286, 206144, 34192, '<td valign="top">In this challenge, "Creativity is the Key" is what I am using to score images.  After looking at 100 piles of wood, I find this image a breath of fresh air.  For me personally, I would have lowered my point of view a little, but I love the composition and the tones.  The images makes me think about for a moment or two, and it amuses me.  A little crop on the right wouldn''t hurt but honestly, I applaud your sense of whimsy.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'In this challenge, "Creativity is the Key" is what I am using to score images.  After looking at 100 piles of wood, I find this image a breath of fresh air.  For me personally, I would have lowered my point of view a little, but I love the composition and the tones.  The images makes me think about for a moment or two, and it amuses me.  A little crop on the right wouldn''t hurt but honestly, I applaud your sense of whimsy.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 10:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
