(1561428, 208554, 34192, '<td valign="top">In this challenge, "Creativity is the Key" is what I am using to score images.  Not too thrilled about the title but I love the image.  The tilt on the right is a little distracting but it is due to a ground level POV - we take what we can.  I really like the tones - many might complain it is too dark but I think that is what works for me.  The reflections in the glass add movement to what otherwise might be static.  Crop is a little tight for my tastes but overall, well done and creative!  7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'In this challenge, "Creativity is the Key" is what I am using to score images.  Not too thrilled about the title but I love the image.  The tilt on the right is a little distracting but it is due to a ground level POV - we take what we can.  I really like the tones - many might complain it is too dark but I think that is what works for me.  The reflections in the glass add movement to what otherwise might be static.  Crop is a little tight for my tastes but overall, well done and creative!  7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561434, 205728, 36499, '<td valign="top">I love these little buckets...what are they used for? what are the charcters on them? i love this photo..makes me want to know more(PM me with the answers please) this is getting an 8 from me because i wish the light was shining down the row rather than on a few buckets.</td>', 'I love these little buckets...what are they used for? what are the charcters on them? i love this photo..makes me want to know more(PM me with the answers please) this is getting an 8 from me because i wish the light was shining down the row rather than on a few buckets.', '2005-07-25 11:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561436, 208552, 34192, '<td valign="top">In this challenge, "Creativity is the Key" is what I am using to score images.  I really like this image.  The twist in the stair (composition) and lighting are what make it work for me.  I like that the stairs get lighter as they rise - they are leading me somewhere and the urge is to follow.  The tones work well.  You might be able to crop just a little bit on the left - the dark tones and flatness of that piece/wall are like an impediment to climbing the stairs.  Make sense?  Not take it all the way out but just limit it a little more.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'In this challenge, "Creativity is the Key" is what I am using to score images.  I really like this image.  The twist in the stair (composition) and lighting are what make it work for me.  I like that the stairs get lighter as they rise - they are leading me somewhere and the urge is to follow.  The tones work well.  You might be able to crop just a little bit on the left - the dark tones and flatness of that piece/wall are like an impediment to climbing the stairs.  Make sense?  Not take it all the way out but just limit it a little more.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 11:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
