(1561803, 208491, 38492, '<td valign="top">The line in the top right is distracting, and the edge at the front of the metronome is out of focus. Whilst you''ve given us some nice detail here, I would have preferred to see more/all of the metronome. I can''t help feeling that a slow shot of the whole hand sweeping out part of its arc would meet your title better, and give some movement to the shot.<br/></td>', 'The line in the top right is distracting, and the edge at the front of the metronome is out of focus. Whilst you''ve given us some nice detail here, I would have preferred to see more/all of the metronome. I can''t help feeling that a slow shot of the whole hand sweeping out part of its arc would meet your title better, and give some movement to the shot.', '2005-07-25 14:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
