(1561908, 206115, 34192, '<td valign="top">One of the criteria for this challenge is "Creativity is the Key" so my scoring will be based on this.  While there are other pieces of wood in this challenge, the lighting in this one sets it above the rest.  I like the tones used, the DOF and POV are great and the focus is good for the image.  The subject itself really doesn''t thrill me, but I could see this hanging on the wall of a carpenter or weekend warrior type.  8 - Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'One of the criteria for this challenge is "Creativity is the Key" so my scoring will be based on this.  While there are other pieces of wood in this challenge, the lighting in this one sets it above the rest.  I like the tones used, the DOF and POV are great and the focus is good for the image.  The subject itself really doesn''t thrill me, but I could see this hanging on the wall of a carpenter or weekend warrior type.  8 - Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 15:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
