(1561921, 208492, 34192, '<td valign="top">One of the criteria for this challenge is "Creativity is the Key" so my scoring will be based on this.  Very interesting image.  Love the subtle use of color.  The composition is strange but not distractingly so (I''m not sure why this image was made).  The focus is dead on and  the lighting is excellent. I''m repeatedly drawn to the arm, maybe that''s where the horn was? of the record player - its smoothness and tone pulls my eye.  Well done!  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'One of the criteria for this challenge is "Creativity is the Key" so my scoring will be based on this.  Very interesting image.  Love the subtle use of color.  The composition is strange but not distractingly so (I''m not sure why this image was made).  The focus is dead on and  the lighting is excellent. I''m repeatedly drawn to the arm, maybe that''s where the horn was? of the record player - its smoothness and tone pulls my eye.  Well done!  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 15:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561922, 208635, 37215, '<td valign="top">doesn;t grab me in b/w but a good capture. sharp good dof</td>', 'doesn;t grab me in b/w but a good capture. sharp good dof', '2005-07-25 15:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
