(1561926, 208527, 37234, '<td valign="top">I think this is a neat idea but the ship in the background is TOO blurred. It actually makes me want to avert my eyes. Other than that, I think your concept is fantastic.</td>', 'I think this is a neat idea but the ship in the background is TOO blurred. It actually makes me want to avert my eyes. Other than that, I think your concept is fantastic.', '2005-07-25 15:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561928, 206345, 34192, '<td valign="top">One of the criteria for this challenge is "Creativity is the Key" so my scoring will be based on this.  this image has an almost painted look.  I love the inclusion of the tree branch to balance out the cloud.  The tones are rendered well.  POV, DOF, composition, focus all done well.  A lot of empty sky but I don''t think it hurts the image.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'One of the criteria for this challenge is "Creativity is the Key" so my scoring will be based on this.  this image has an almost painted look.  I love the inclusion of the tree branch to balance out the cloud.  The tones are rendered well.  POV, DOF, composition, focus all done well.  A lot of empty sky but I don''t think it hurts the image.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 15:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
