(1562270, 208621, 37234, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition. In my opinion, it appears over-processed. A bit too much color saturation and NeatImage? Unsure, obviously I''m just guessing at what you did. It''s still a great photo, though. 7</td>', 'This is a great composition. In my opinion, it appears over-processed. A bit too much color saturation and NeatImage? Unsure, obviously I''m just guessing at what you did. It''s still a great photo, though. 7', '2005-07-25 17:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
