(1562272, 208663, 36981, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image - it looks like a very beautiful place.  I like the concept of the sun being behind the crosses, and then silhoueting the crosses, but ultimately it doesn''t work for me.  I think that in order to get any detail on the cross, you had to overexpose the sky.  I wonder if shooting at an angle to the sun would have helped out here, or perhaps waiting for the sun to go even lower.  Beautiful colors though.</td>', 'This is an interesting image - it looks like a very beautiful place.  I like the concept of the sun being behind the crosses, and then silhoueting the crosses, but ultimately it doesn''t work for me.  I think that in order to get any detail on the cross, you had to overexpose the sky.  I wonder if shooting at an angle to the sun would have helped out here, or perhaps waiting for the sun to go even lower.  Beautiful colors though.', '2005-07-25 17:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562273, 207774, 37234, '<td valign="top">Very cool selective desat. Great detail. Fantastic composition. One of my top picks. 9</td>', 'Very cool selective desat. Great detail. Fantastic composition. One of my top picks. 9', '2005-07-25 17:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562275, 208672, 36981, '<td valign="top">I like the image.  It''s very well photographed, and the water is well caught with great lights.  I think the reflections in the water are perhaps a bit distracting, and the association with the challenge probably is too weak to be hugely successful.</td>', 'I like the image.  It''s very well photographed, and the water is well caught with great lights.  I think the reflections in the water are perhaps a bit distracting, and the association with the challenge probably is too weak to be hugely successful.', '2005-07-25 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
