(1562277, 207928, 37234, '<td valign="top">Well, I hope this one doesn''t get voted down because of the lack of "visible" wood. I think it''s a great "out of the box" idea, and a great capture. I''ll be interested to follow up on this one to find out where it was taken.</td>', 'Well, I hope this one doesn''t get voted down because of the lack of "visible" wood. I think it''s a great "out of the box" idea, and a great capture. I''ll be interested to follow up on this one to find out where it was taken.', '2005-07-25 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
