(1562324, 208414, 40355, '<td valign="top">Really neat use of light and shadow.  Might have been neat to try it so that the sun could be seen and create a lens flare.  Overall, great shot!</td>', 'Really neat use of light and shadow.  Might have been neat to try it so that the sun could be seen and create a lens flare.  Overall, great shot!', '2005-07-25 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562326, 207767, 37234, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and color. 8</td>', 'Great DOF and color. 8', '2005-07-25 17:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562351, 208470, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, while the texture of this tree bark is interesting, as an image it leaves me flat.  This image shows wood but doesn''t go far beyond that.  To score well in challenges one needs to go beyond the first thought, such as ''tree,'' to the fifth or sixth thought.  Imagewise, the focus is a little soft for the subject and the composition doesn''t add anything to the image. 3</td>', 'Honestly, while the texture of this tree bark is interesting, as an image it leaves me flat.  This image shows wood but doesn''t go far beyond that.  To score well in challenges one needs to go beyond the first thought, such as ''tree,'' to the fifth or sixth thought.  Imagewise, the focus is a little soft for the subject and the composition doesn''t add anything to the image. 3', '2005-07-25 17:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562360, 206345, 37234, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. Nice colors, perfect DOF, fantastic composition. If I had to complain about anything, it would be the appearance of slight oversharpening (halo''s around the bench) followed by a bit too much NeatImage. Like I said, "appearance of" - I have no idea if this is really the case. This is my favorite image in this challenge. I hope you do well. 10</td>', 'This is a great image. Nice colors, perfect DOF, fantastic composition. If I had to complain about anything, it would be the appearance of slight oversharpening (halo''s around the bench) followed by a bit too much NeatImage. Like I said, "appearance of" - I have no idea if this is really the case. This is my favorite image in this challenge. I hope you do well. 10', '2005-07-25 18:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562361, 208666, 34192, '<td valign="top">The technique used here is interesting but I''m not sure of its use in this image.  Why is the person only ''kind of'' there?  Does the use of this effect add anything to the composition?  Creative, yes, I will give you that!  Technically, this image needs some help.  The bit of frame at the top should have been cropped out, the image should have been rotated to straight (slight tilt doesn''t add anything in my opinion).  So,  my score for this image is a 4 - you got a plus 1 for creativity but a minus 2 for technicals.</td>', 'The technique used here is interesting but I''m not sure of its use in this image.  Why is the person only ''kind of'' there?  Does the use of this effect add anything to the composition?  Creative, yes, I will give you that!  Technically, this image needs some help.  The bit of frame at the top should have been cropped out, the image should have been rotated to straight (slight tilt doesn''t add anything in my opinion).  So,  my score for this image is a 4 - you got a plus 1 for creativity but a minus 2 for technicals.', '2005-07-25 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562367, 207607, 4810, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2005-07-25 18:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562369, 208149, 34192, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is a sound image.  Its in focus, the lighting is okay, composition okay.  But I honeslty don''t see wood as an important component in this image.  4</td>', 'Technically, this is a sound image.  Its in focus, the lighting is okay, composition okay.  But I honeslty don''t see wood as an important component in this image.  4', '2005-07-25 18:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562373, 208517, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting subject but I find the execution coming up a bit short.  For me at least, a large part of the instrument is lost in the background.  The lighting is okay but the backgorund should have been a different color so as not to lose the subject.  The composition is rather static due to the lighting and background. 4</td>', 'This is an interesting subject but I find the execution coming up a bit short.  For me at least, a large part of the instrument is lost in the background.  The lighting is okay but the backgorund should have been a different color so as not to lose the subject.  The composition is rather static due to the lighting and background. 4', '2005-07-25 18:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562375, 207754, 34192, '<td valign="top">It took me a few minutes to figure out what this was.  The lighting does not help at all.  The crop is awkward, leaving me bits and pieces but I can''t tell what is the focus.  This could be reshot, maybe on an overcast day to get rid of the hots spots, maybe with the photographer on a more even plane with the ladder.  This would give a clearer view of what you as the photographer saw.  3</td>', 'It took me a few minutes to figure out what this was.  The lighting does not help at all.  The crop is awkward, leaving me bits and pieces but I can''t tell what is the focus.  This could be reshot, maybe on an overcast day to get rid of the hots spots, maybe with the photographer on a more even plane with the ladder.  This would give a clearer view of what you as the photographer saw.  3', '2005-07-25 18:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562400, 208387, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find this image very intriguing due to the inclusion of the tree.  I really think that adds so much though I''m stumped as to figure out why.  I think it may be the competing textures - the randomness of the tree balances out the rigidity of the vertical wood.  Irregardless, I like the tones, the composition, think the DOF and POV are perfect and think the lighting works.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I find this image very intriguing due to the inclusion of the tree.  I really think that adds so much though I''m stumped as to figure out why.  I think it may be the competing textures - the randomness of the tree balances out the rigidity of the vertical wood.  Irregardless, I like the tones, the composition, think the DOF and POV are perfect and think the lighting works.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 18:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562432, 207427, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  Reminds me of Rothko, or at least the abstract expressionists.  Very well done.  Like the shadowing that give the image a good 3 dimensional quality.  Really rather fascinating when you look at it.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  Reminds me of Rothko, or at least the abstract expressionists.  Very well done.  Like the shadowing that give the image a good 3 dimensional quality.  Really rather fascinating when you look at it.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562437, 208602, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very simple composition that I enjoy.  I prefer B&amp;W but I think it is pretty cool as it is.  I can''t tell if the fuzziness in the upper right is noise or sharpening artifacts.  Like hte lighting. 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very simple composition that I enjoy.  I prefer B&W but I think it is pretty cool as it is.  I can''t tell if the fuzziness in the upper right is noise or sharpening artifacts.  Like hte lighting. 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-25 18:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562442, 208686, 34192, '<td valign="top">The tree bark is beautiful but I am not sure the lighting is the best it could be for this image.  The tree is so dark and the leaves so light they distract.  Maybe revisiting this at a different time of day would help. 4</td>', 'The tree bark is beautiful but I am not sure the lighting is the best it could be for this image.  The tree is so dark and the leaves so light they distract.  Maybe revisiting this at a different time of day would help. 4', '2005-07-25 18:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562444, 207980, 34192, '<td valign="top">Its interesting that you were able to get a well focused image with the light such as it is.  The image could use some rotation so the chair doesn''t look like its falling forward.  4</td>', 'Its interesting that you were able to get a well focused image with the light such as it is.  The image could use some rotation so the chair doesn''t look like its falling forward.  4', '2005-07-25 18:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562450, 208556, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think what would have made this image really pop is if the background, what is seen through the hole, was in focus and viewable.  As it is, the image is rather static.  there is some tension with the chain but I am left wondering why the image was taken. Technically, this image is in focus and the lighting is okay. 4</td>', 'I think what would have made this image really pop is if the background, what is seen through the hole, was in focus and viewable.  As it is, the image is rather static.  there is some tension with the chain but I am left wondering why the image was taken. Technically, this image is in focus and the lighting is okay. 4', '2005-07-25 18:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562454, 206818, 34192, '<td valign="top">This image is small which will not help it in the voting.  I am wondering what your focus is here.  The juxtaposition of the real tree with the processed wood?  I think, for a more creative image a different time of day with better lighting would greatly improve the image. 4</td>', 'This image is small which will not help it in the voting.  I am wondering what your focus is here.  The juxtaposition of the real tree with the processed wood?  I think, for a more creative image a different time of day with better lighting would greatly improve the image. 4', '2005-07-25 18:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
