(1562492, 207827, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like outdoors, I had a hard time finding anything I would enter out there... This with the light, is really very nice.. Its got a cool feel to it. the texture is noticealbe and the perspective is nice as well. I really like it. Good job.</td>', 'I like outdoors, I had a hard time finding anything I would enter out there... This with the light, is really very nice.. Its got a cool feel to it. the texture is noticealbe and the perspective is nice as well. I really like it. Good job.', '2005-07-25 19:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562498, 207643, 9581, '<td valign="top">LOL... I love how tricks work... This paticualar technique with the frame you done so well with. I see a flower above the yellow, one that has created a hole and it is sord of looking like its more fake then real the way it hangs.. Not trying to be to picky but only letting you know as I need it all the time to perfect something I am doing in setups like this.. I love the cats how on earth you got 2 of them to sit ther like that geez...Are you communicating with them? :) The wall behind is made of wood to so all in looks like you took the trick of this use of a frame made it your own  and perfected here...Great shot.!!</td>', 'LOL... I love how tricks work... This paticualar technique with the frame you done so well with. I see a flower above the yellow, one that has created a hole and it is sord of looking like its more fake then real the way it hangs.. Not trying to be to picky but only letting you know as I need it all the time to perfect something I am doing in setups like this.. I love the cats how on earth you got 2 of them to sit ther like that geez...Are you communicating with them? :) The wall behind is made of wood to so all in looks like you took the trick of this use of a frame made it your own  and perfected here...Great shot.!!', '2005-07-25 19:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562503, 208501, 9581, '<td valign="top">Its to bad there wasnt just a tad more light at the bottom to see the soap stand out more. I like this though and technically I think this has been taking very well... I like how theres no extra sharp spot lights on the board and the basket is there its noticable very well.</td>', 'Its to bad there wasnt just a tad more light at the bottom to see the soap stand out more. I like this though and technically I think this has been taking very well... I like how theres no extra sharp spot lights on the board and the basket is there its noticable very well.', '2005-07-25 19:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562504, 208498, 9581, '<td valign="top">The crop here is kind of small, whats inside I want to see...I like the full shot of the cabinet and excellent light there in the opening..Its almost a spotlight or omni affect in so so kind of way..  7</td>', 'The crop here is kind of small, whats inside I want to see...I like the full shot of the cabinet and excellent light there in the opening..Its almost a spotlight or omni affect in so so kind of way..  7', '2005-07-25 19:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
