(1562597, 208157, 20530, '<td valign="top">Everytime I think I''ve come up with a unique subject, someone else does it (and usually much better, as in this case). I have one of these in dark wood, and it''s one of my favorite things. My first try didn''t come out well and then I went out of town. Glad I didn''t submit my image;  this would have put it to shame. I like the black background and the composition. PS, trying to remember what these are called. If you know, please tell me.</td>', 'Everytime I think I''ve come up with a unique subject, someone else does it (and usually much better, as in this case). I have one of these in dark wood, and it''s one of my favorite things. My first try didn''t come out well and then I went out of town. Glad I didn''t submit my image;  this would have put it to shame. I like the black background and the composition. PS, trying to remember what these are called. If you know, please tell me.', '2005-07-25 20:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562601, 208543, 39339, '<td valign="top">i think this is a really nice shot -- great composition - the walking trail leads the eye through the entire photo.  i hope this shot does well for you.  i love it, but i can see where the "wooden police" will not give you the score you deserve because the wooden posts aren''t more obvious.</td>', 'i think this is a really nice shot -- great composition - the walking trail leads the eye through the entire photo.  i hope this shot does well for you.  i love it, but i can see where the "wooden police" will not give you the score you deserve because the wooden posts aren''t more obvious.', '2005-07-25 20:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
