(1563791, 208492, 40459, '<td valign="top">Love this photo.  Love that the record is broken.  I actually wish the record featured more in the photo, but understand that the focal point is the wood, not the record.  Love the colors.</td>', 'Love this photo.  Love that the record is broken.  I actually wish the record featured more in the photo, but understand that the focal point is the wood, not the record.  Love the colors.', '2005-07-26 09:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563792, 208630, 40459, '<td valign="top">!!!  I live in London, England now, but grew up riding the Thunderbolt!  Still one of the best rollarcoasters in the world!  Nice!</td>', '!!!  I live in London, England now, but grew up riding the Thunderbolt!  Still one of the best rollarcoasters in the world!  Nice!', '2005-07-26 09:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563796, 208427, 40459, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in the photo but, to make the wood the feature, you would have needed to make it a bit more prominant, probably by making it fill up more of the frame.  If I wasn''t feature the wood, I probably would have included just a bit more sky and a bit less eath, but that''s me.  Still, it''s a lovely photo.</td>', 'Love the colors in the photo but, to make the wood the feature, you would have needed to make it a bit more prominant, probably by making it fill up more of the frame.  If I wasn''t feature the wood, I probably would have included just a bit more sky and a bit less eath, but that''s me.  Still, it''s a lovely photo.', '2005-07-26 09:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563799, 208674, 40459, '<td valign="top">Would have loved it if the boardwalk on the right had featured more in the photo.  Might have been good to crop out the city/skyline.  Getting this shot without people in it would have also been a bonus.  You might have gone a bit overboard with the blue.</td>', 'Would have loved it if the boardwalk on the right had featured more in the photo.  Might have been good to crop out the city/skyline.  Getting this shot without people in it would have also been a bonus.  You might have gone a bit overboard with the blue.', '2005-07-26 09:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
