(1563802, 208662, 40459, '<td valign="top">If not for the blurryness of the bottom edge of this photo, it would be perfect!  I also wish it were straight, but that''s just me.  Too bad the sky is hazy.</td>', 'If not for the blurryness of the bottom edge of this photo, it would be perfect!  I also wish it were straight, but that''s just me.  Too bad the sky is hazy.', '2005-07-26 10:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
