(1563815, 208517, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I never knew what a didgeridoo was until now!<br/>["A musical instrument of the Aboriginal peoples of Australia, consisting of a long hollow branch or stick that makes a deep drone when blown into."]<br/>I love learning new words - thanks!  And you captured a very unusual instrument quite well.  :-)</td>', 'Interesting image.  I never knew what a didgeridoo was until now!["A musical instrument of the Aboriginal peoples of Australia, consisting of a long hollow branch or stick that makes a deep drone when blown into."]I love learning new words - thanks!  And you captured a very unusual instrument quite well.  :-)', '2005-07-26 10:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
