(1563818, 208590, 31917, '<td valign="top">simple, clean, and i never thought till looking at this photo how nestalgic a spoon could be. . .it''s been at every family meal, family functions, holidays. .picnics. .and if your like me, it was there when you got a whoopin.. . ahhh the memories. . 7</td>', 'simple, clean, and i never thought till looking at this photo how nestalgic a spoon could be. . .it''s been at every family meal, family functions, holidays. .picnics. .and if your like me, it was there when you got a whoopin.. . ahhh the memories. . 7', '2005-07-26 10:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
