(1564264, 208304, 24454, '<td valign="top">That''s what I love:  pictures that enhance the subject with something really cool to look at, because wood by itself is pretty boring.     I hope you are not getting the "subject is the squirrel not the wood" comment.   I had a picture something like this for another challenge and it got beat up unmercifully for that reason -- I hope not here because it''s really a neat picture.    My only suggestion would be that I think it might have been better with a slightly bigger depth of field so the whole wooden log was in focus.  But I love it anyway!  8</td>', 'That''s what I love:  pictures that enhance the subject with something really cool to look at, because wood by itself is pretty boring.     I hope you are not getting the "subject is the squirrel not the wood" comment.   I had a picture something like this for another challenge and it got beat up unmercifully for that reason -- I hope not here because it''s really a neat picture.    My only suggestion would be that I think it might have been better with a slightly bigger depth of field so the whole wooden log was in focus.  But I love it anyway!  8', '2005-07-26 14:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
