(1565271, 208407, 35602, '<td valign="top">a very interesting shot.  When I first looked at it I thought that the wood was actually a swirling ocean.  Didn''t know it was wood.  As I look at it closer, that trick of the eye really makes this a great composition.  Your title indicates you saw the same thing, since you used a nautical term.</td>', 'a very interesting shot.  When I first looked at it I thought that the wood was actually a swirling ocean.  Didn''t know it was wood.  As I look at it closer, that trick of the eye really makes this a great composition.  Your title indicates you saw the same thing, since you used a nautical term.', '2005-07-27 00:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1565273, 208560, 30061, '<td valign="top">Selective desat is really overdone, but you used it well and used it appropriately here.  I love the expression on his face.  Beautiful composition.  If I could vote in this challenge, I''d give it a 9.</td>', 'Selective desat is really overdone, but you used it well and used it appropriately here.  I love the expression on his face.  Beautiful composition.  If I could vote in this challenge, I''d give it a 9.', '2005-07-27 00:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
