(1566378, 208300, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was a really cool shot.  As I scroll down to look at the image the toothed wheel actually looks like it moves.  I have to give this one a 10  I am having a ball moving the picture up and down and watching the wheel turn.  Your lighting was perfect to create such an optical illusion.</td>', 'This was a really cool shot.  As I scroll down to look at the image the toothed wheel actually looks like it moves.  I have to give this one a 10  I am having a ball moving the picture up and down and watching the wheel turn.  Your lighting was perfect to create such an optical illusion.', '2005-07-27 09:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
