(1567073, 207011, 3102, '<td valign="top">I suppose that somewhere, somehow there could be wood in there, but it''s certainly not a main component of the shot...</td>', 'I suppose that somewhere, somehow there could be wood in there, but it''s certainly not a main component of the shot...', '2005-07-27 13:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567161, 208630, 3102, '<td valign="top">Weeeee!   The one ride at Kennywood my daughter still isn''t tall enough to go on.  Oddly enough, we *could* go on the Phantom''s Revenge!  :)</td>', 'Weeeee!   The one ride at Kennywood my daughter still isn''t tall enough to go on.  Oddly enough, we *could* go on the Phantom''s Revenge!  :)', '2005-07-27 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567242, 208015, 41382, '<td valign="top">The thumb caught my eye, but the direct overhead lighting is a little harsh.<br/>Good cropping and subject. Wait for sunset or get up early and capture this historic barn before it falls down.</td>', 'The thumb caught my eye, but the direct overhead lighting is a little harsh.Good cropping and subject. Wait for sunset or get up early and capture this historic barn before it falls down.', '2005-07-27 14:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567271, 207036, 41382, '<td valign="top">Your barn is going to fall over. Great lighting!! If you have photoshop, I would suggest trying to correct the lens perspective problems. Get the left side of the barn lined up with the right side in the vertical planes. Karl.</td>', 'Your barn is going to fall over. Great lighting!! If you have photoshop, I would suggest trying to correct the lens perspective problems. Get the left side of the barn lined up with the right side in the vertical planes. Karl.', '2005-07-27 14:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567306, 206345, 37200, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moody image.  I like the perspective/composition and the rounded/used feel of the bench.  The only suggestion is to go easy on the sharpening, there are a lot of halos around the bench.</td>', 'Beautiful moody image.  I like the perspective/composition and the rounded/used feel of the bench.  The only suggestion is to go easy on the sharpening, there are a lot of halos around the bench.', '2005-07-27 14:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567331, 208609, 37200, '<td valign="top">neat idea, but looks a bit out of place.</td>', 'neat idea, but looks a bit out of place.', '2005-07-27 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567349, 206345, 14735, '<td valign="top">The post processing in this is great. I like the angle and the composition</td>', 'The post processing in this is great. I like the angle and the composition', '2005-07-27 14:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567354, 207849, 14735, '<td valign="top">Seems like a place people forgot about. Nice work</td>', 'Seems like a place people forgot about. Nice work', '2005-07-27 14:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567364, 208600, 14735, '<td valign="top">Lots of noise in this. Also not very sharp</td>', 'Lots of noise in this. Also not very sharp', '2005-07-27 14:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567368, 208124, 37200, '<td valign="top">Very rustic.  Love the fence there.  I may try toning down the saturation a bit more.  Also, looks like an un-natural gray splotch to the right of the chimney (maybe from burning a hot spot??).</td>', 'Very rustic.  Love the fence there.  I may try toning down the saturation a bit more.  Also, looks like an un-natural gray splotch to the right of the chimney (maybe from burning a hot spot??).', '2005-07-27 14:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567372, 208303, 14735, '<td valign="top">The light is very flat in this shot</td>', 'The light is very flat in this shot', '2005-07-27 14:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567382, 208434, 37200, '<td valign="top">These are obviously wooden sail boats, and it''s a nice shot.  But, I am not really feeling the wood as a major element.</td>', 'These are obviously wooden sail boats, and it''s a nice shot.  But, I am not really feeling the wood as a major element.', '2005-07-27 15:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567385, 207372, 37200, '<td valign="top">nice macro, great texture.  Like the fact that the whole thing is in focus (not too shallow DOF).</td>', 'nice macro, great texture.  Like the fact that the whole thing is in focus (not too shallow DOF).', '2005-07-27 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567388, 208335, 14735, '<td valign="top">It looks as though you tried to dodge the bench and left a halo around it. If this is what you wanted to do I am not sure I care for it, if you were trying to lighten up the bench you need to first make a selection out of it and then dodge.</td>', 'It looks as though you tried to dodge the bench and left a halo around it. If this is what you wanted to do I am not sure I care for it, if you were trying to lighten up the bench you need to first make a selection out of it and then dodge.', '2005-07-27 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
