(1568418, 208630, 24511, '<td valign="top">White painted wood on light blue sky background does not stand out.  The strong dark red rails do.  People are having a great time except for the third row, the blue t-shirt in the fourth row and the second last lady at the top left row.  I can`t figure out why the composition seems to be missing something.  Small left triangle shape at lower left corner and huge vertical drop line across the middle send me off the page and downward.  I would like a close-up on the faces or an angle from the falling seats.  Great looking structure.  5 pointer cause I love coasters.  Good luck.</td>', 'White painted wood on light blue sky background does not stand out.  The strong dark red rails do.  People are having a great time except for the third row, the blue t-shirt in the fourth row and the second last lady at the top left row.  I can`t figure out why the composition seems to be missing something.  Small left triangle shape at lower left corner and huge vertical drop line across the middle send me off the page and downward.  I would like a close-up on the faces or an angle from the falling seats.  Great looking structure.  5 pointer cause I love coasters.  Good luck.', '2005-07-27 21:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568438, 207995, 24511, '<td valign="top">Wood meets metal neat idea.  I just find the shapes and the reflection on the none wood items more interesting.  A fancy antique starburst patern would have gotten you a 10 from this fellow guitarist.  Having the instrument being played may have put life into your shot.  Yours gets a 4 and the hope that music themes get put into future challenges soon.  Thanks.</td>', 'Wood meets metal neat idea.  I just find the shapes and the reflection on the none wood items more interesting.  A fancy antique starburst patern would have gotten you a 10 from this fellow guitarist.  Having the instrument being played may have put life into your shot.  Yours gets a 4 and the hope that music themes get put into future challenges soon.  Thanks.', '2005-07-27 21:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568461, 208679, 24511, '<td valign="top">London bridge is not falling down on the dpchallenger extraordinaire of this sapphire shot.  Colors, lines and framing first got my attention and I was thinking 10 and favorites list.  Then I felt irritation with the star drops on the waters surface.  The faint cables are reflective beauties and remind me of sails on a ship.  Despite my better judgement I will give you a weak 10 for the art to heart vibration that the photo gives me.  Thanks.</td>', 'London bridge is not falling down on the dpchallenger extraordinaire of this sapphire shot.  Colors, lines and framing first got my attention and I was thinking 10 and favorites list.  Then I felt irritation with the star drops on the waters surface.  The faint cables are reflective beauties and remind me of sails on a ship.  Despite my better judgement I will give you a weak 10 for the art to heart vibration that the photo gives me.  Thanks.', '2005-07-27 22:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
