(1568668, 208049, 40809, '<td valign="top">If the title is "smallest," then I''m looking for the smallest to be the focal point, but it seems she;s slightly blurred.</td>', 'If the title is "smallest," then I''m looking for the smallest to be the focal point, but it seems she;s slightly blurred.', '2005-07-27 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
