(1569659, 208180, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the glowing light.  The shot is well framed ( no pun intended.)  There is a bit of a sense of clutter to the photo that makes it harder to comprehend.</td>', 'I love the glowing light.  The shot is well framed ( no pun intended.)  There is a bit of a sense of clutter to the photo that makes it harder to comprehend.', '2005-07-28 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
