(1570231, 206266, 21362, '<td valign="top">Lighting and color are great. I love the warm dusky rays of the sun and the dimension the light and shadow give the building. The exposure on the gorgeous blue sky is excellent.<br/> <br/>It''s hard to know where to focus, the photo doesn''t lead the eye to the subject. I bounce between the lighthouse, the boat, the distracting pink flowers at the frame edge, and the overhanging ceiling, unable to really focus on the lovely lighthouse. Getting in closer somehow, leaving out all the background clutter would''ve helped make a more powerful image I think.</td>', 'Lighting and color are great. I love the warm dusky rays of the sun and the dimension the light and shadow give the building. The exposure on the gorgeous blue sky is excellent. It''s hard to know where to focus, the photo doesn''t lead the eye to the subject. I bounce between the lighthouse, the boat, the distracting pink flowers at the frame edge, and the overhanging ceiling, unable to really focus on the lovely lighthouse. Getting in closer somehow, leaving out all the background clutter would''ve helped make a more powerful image I think.', '2005-07-28 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
