(1570423, 208673, 41344, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2005-07-28 18:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570429, 208492, 19831, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a nice idea. Some of the topic ''police'' people may hit it because they will think the main subject is the record, and not wood, but for me, I think it is a creative refreshing approach to the challenge. I find it has good interest factor to me. Compositionally, something seems to be lacking a little to me. I''m not saying this is bad at all, it is not, but something inside me is really saying that there is potential here for a much stronger presentation. Maybe because I do find it as a subject fresh and interesting. I wish I had a suggestion, but nothing immediate comes to mind that I can put my finger on, perhaps just a different perspective/angle.</td>', 'I find this to be a nice idea. Some of the topic ''police'' people may hit it because they will think the main subject is the record, and not wood, but for me, I think it is a creative refreshing approach to the challenge. I find it has good interest factor to me. Compositionally, something seems to be lacking a little to me. I''m not saying this is bad at all, it is not, but something inside me is really saying that there is potential here for a much stronger presentation. Maybe because I do find it as a subject fresh and interesting. I wish I had a suggestion, but nothing immediate comes to mind that I can put my finger on, perhaps just a different perspective/angle.', '2005-07-28 18:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570439, 206616, 19831, '<td valign="top">Some people come up with some very creative shots with woodies, and I find this to be a great example :-)  Lighting is great, wonderful dof, good composition. I really like how not only have you pulled off humor, but some emotion as well out of a woodie shot. Overall, very clever, creative concept, executed quite nicely IMO. Nice job. thanks.</td>', 'Some people come up with some very creative shots with woodies, and I find this to be a great example :-)  Lighting is great, wonderful dof, good composition. I really like how not only have you pulled off humor, but some emotion as well out of a woodie shot. Overall, very clever, creative concept, executed quite nicely IMO. Nice job. thanks.', '2005-07-28 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570452, 207619, 30222, '<td valign="top">the more profound attachement with the trunk is very credible here<br/>tho a minor that the facial expression is half lost to complete this highly original rendition</td>', 'the more profound attachement with the trunk is very credible heretho a minor that the facial expression is half lost to complete this highly original rendition', '2005-07-28 18:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570453, 208667, 93, '<td valign="top">Although I understand what you were going for here.. you just haven''t made the photo enough about *wood*..  It''s about fire.. even if it *is* wood that is fuelling it. <br/> <br/>Just my opinion though, and it''s a pretty nice shot..</td>', 'Although I understand what you were going for here.. you just haven''t made the photo enough about *wood*..  It''s about fire.. even if it *is* wood that is fuelling it.  Just my opinion though, and it''s a pretty nice shot..', '2005-07-28 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570457, 208633, 93, '<td valign="top">very original and great lighting... and, of course.. I love the shallow DOF... I''m a sucker for it.<br/> <br/>Border actually works here too.. imagine that.</td>', 'very original and great lighting... and, of course.. I love the shallow DOF... I''m a sucker for it. Border actually works here too.. imagine that.', '2005-07-28 18:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570462, 205721, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting comments like, "but a flower isn''t wood" or "Wood is supposed to be the main subject"..  am I right?  <br/> <br/>Poor sheepish DPCers. :)  Love the lighting here..  could have done without the burned vignetting..  to each their own.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting comments like, "but a flower isn''t wood" or "Wood is supposed to be the main subject"..  am I right?   Poor sheepish DPCers. :)  Love the lighting here..  could have done without the burned vignetting..  to each their own.', '2005-07-28 18:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570470, 208519, 93, '<td valign="top">More about flame and fire than wood IMO.. even with the argument that without wood there''d be no flame. hehe.</td>', 'More about flame and fire than wood IMO.. even with the argument that without wood there''d be no flame. hehe.', '2005-07-28 18:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570479, 207619, 93, '<td valign="top">Very creative ..  but the lighting just isn''t grabbing me.</td>', 'Very creative ..  but the lighting just isn''t grabbing me.', '2005-07-28 18:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570534, 208373, 38267, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think this shot would have been better if more of the wood grain was in focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think this shot would have been better if more of the wood grain was in focus.', '2005-07-28 19:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570537, 208662, 38267, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  It makes me think that I''m right there on the dock with the way you did the composition.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  It makes me think that I''m right there on the dock with the way you did the composition.', '2005-07-28 19:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570646, 207817, 31214, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting complaints about the bird being the subject and not the wood....but I like the picture anyway.  Good job.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting complaints about the bird being the subject and not the wood....but I like the picture anyway.  Good job.', '2005-07-28 20:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570649, 208637, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea....I only wish the tail was in focus too.</td>', 'Very cool idea....I only wish the tail was in focus too.', '2005-07-28 20:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570656, 208028, 31214, '<td valign="top">Old wagons always do well.  Nice B/W shot!</td>', 'Old wagons always do well.  Nice B/W shot!', '2005-07-28 20:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570660, 207827, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very artistic composition.  Like the lighting.  Bothered by the pine needles.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very artistic composition.  Like the lighting.  Bothered by the pine needles.  Nice job.', '2005-07-28 21:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570662, 207627, 31214, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting!</td>', 'Cool lighting!', '2005-07-28 21:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570666, 206115, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like the saw dust.....falling out into deep space.  Cool!</td>', 'I like the saw dust.....falling out into deep space.  Cool!', '2005-07-28 21:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570730, 208597, 30881, '<td valign="top">Excellent! When b&amp;w is done properly it really shows great contrast. My first place choice.<br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent! When b&w is done properly it really shows great contrast. My first place choice.Very well done.', '2005-07-28 21:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570737, 208492, 30881, '<td valign="top">Nice original subject matter, well placed and the light/shadow blends well together.<br/>Deserves a top 3 finish</td>', 'Nice original subject matter, well placed and the light/shadow blends well together.Deserves a top 3 finish', '2005-07-28 21:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570743, 208662, 30881, '<td valign="top">Nice photo  and great idea, unfortunately I think the sun is stealing the show. and the wood is not quite sharp enough to keep my attention. Good effort.</td>', 'Nice photo  and great idea, unfortunately I think the sun is stealing the show. and the wood is not quite sharp enough to keep my attention. Good effort.', '2005-07-28 22:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570752, 208148, 30881, '<td valign="top">What a unique idea. Really aced this one!! Well done! This definitely deserves a "10"</td>', 'What a unique idea. Really aced this one!! Well done! This definitely deserves a "10"', '2005-07-28 22:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570759, 207900, 30881, '<td valign="top">If this was in color I''d probably be grumbling about too much white glare, however it works to your advantage in this shot. Would have liked to have seen the weave a bit sharpe. Other than that its a well done image. Congrats.<br/>*me thinks many will pass it by due to subject matter.</td>', 'If this was in color I''d probably be grumbling about too much white glare, however it works to your advantage in this shot. Would have liked to have seen the weave a bit sharpe. Other than that its a well done image. Congrats.*me thinks many will pass it by due to subject matter.', '2005-07-28 22:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570764, 208552, 30881, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting effects in this image, would have liked to see the overall image sharper.</td>', 'I like the lighting effects in this image, would have liked to see the overall image sharper.', '2005-07-28 22:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570772, 207254, 33560, '<td valign="top">I formed my opinion of the photo before scrolling down to see the green mat.  So my comments will start out being based on that ...  I love the tonality of the wood and the fact that it all matches so well.  The soft but strong light is perfectly suited to the treatment; it looks especially good on the vase.<br/> <br/>The mat adds interesting texture and color.  It balances the brass ring.  Yet, somehow it behaves in this picture a bit like an insistant child breaking in on a conversation between two septagenarians in their rocking chairs watching the sun set.   If the mat must stay for some important compositional purpose ( I''m terrible at composition, so am unwilling to assert a judgement here)  then I wonder if selective desaturation or hue manipulation might not soften the loud shade of green to a softer yellower shade that echoes the brass ring.    In any case it''s a very nice photo.</td>', 'I formed my opinion of the photo before scrolling down to see the green mat.  So my comments will start out being based on that ...  I love the tonality of the wood and the fact that it all matches so well.  The soft but strong light is perfectly suited to the treatment; it looks especially good on the vase. The mat adds interesting texture and color.  It balances the brass ring.  Yet, somehow it behaves in this picture a bit like an insistant child breaking in on a conversation between two septagenarians in their rocking chairs watching the sun set.   If the mat must stay for some important compositional purpose ( I''m terrible at composition, so am unwilling to assert a judgement here)  then I wonder if selective desaturation or hue manipulation might not soften the loud shade of green to a softer yellower shade that echoes the brass ring.    In any case it''s a very nice photo.', '2005-07-28 22:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570782, 208676, 8377, '<td valign="top">Awesome dof on this!!! I love how the background really enhances the subject and makes you realize what the picture is of. Very creative!</td>', 'Awesome dof on this!!! I love how the background really enhances the subject and makes you realize what the picture is of. Very creative!', '2005-07-28 22:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570786, 207130, 33560, '<td valign="top">The floating slime is quite interesting.  Its bright green and the black structural steel work well together.  I like the way the water flows diagonally through the photo.  The texture made by the green slime on the lock gates interests me and I wonder whether there might have been a stronger picture in here that emphasizes this ( or if perhaps this texture becomes evident in a good enlargement.. )  In any case, I cannot overcome the impression that the subject is a little weak or diffuse or confusing.</td>', 'The floating slime is quite interesting.  Its bright green and the black structural steel work well together.  I like the way the water flows diagonally through the photo.  The texture made by the green slime on the lock gates interests me and I wonder whether there might have been a stronger picture in here that emphasizes this ( or if perhaps this texture becomes evident in a good enlargement.. )  In any case, I cannot overcome the impression that the subject is a little weak or diffuse or confusing.', '2005-07-28 22:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570793, 207071, 8377, '<td valign="top">LOL, funny title. I really like this pic. I like the colors in it and the darker shades along the edges.</td>', 'LOL, funny title. I really like this pic. I like the colors in it and the darker shades along the edges.', '2005-07-28 22:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570798, 208608, 33560, '<td valign="top">And when you''re done playing, you just pack it away in that little box; hehehe.  <br/> <br/>Interesting choice of subject.  I like the low angle light, the partially finished bit and the way it interacts with the box.  I find the puzzle peices somehow jumble the photo, and while I don''t find the background objectionalble, I cannot help but wonder whether something with a little texture might have been more interesting - even a highly textured sketch paper. It''s hard to advocate less negative space, but I wish one were just a little closer so the woodgrain were more evident.</td>', 'And when you''re done playing, you just pack it away in that little box; hehehe.   Interesting choice of subject.  I like the low angle light, the partially finished bit and the way it interacts with the box.  I find the puzzle peices somehow jumble the photo, and while I don''t find the background objectionalble, I cannot help but wonder whether something with a little texture might have been more interesting - even a highly textured sketch paper. It''s hard to advocate less negative space, but I wish one were just a little closer so the woodgrain were more evident.', '2005-07-28 22:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570827, 206144, 41058, '<td valign="top">Nice play with the lighting, the wood floor expresses good change in texture and grain of wood used in the floor, chairs are dark with play of light on them. Over all I like this pic</td>', 'Nice play with the lighting, the wood floor expresses good change in texture and grain of wood used in the floor, chairs are dark with play of light on them. Over all I like this pic', '2005-07-28 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570842, 208335, 22537, '<td valign="top">Nice subject but slightly too much dodging.  Burning the bench may have drawn out greater detail and the use of the shadow/highlight adjustment may have resulted in more impact.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice subject but slightly too much dodging.  Burning the bench may have drawn out greater detail and the use of the shadow/highlight adjustment may have resulted in more impact.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570850, 208526, 22537, '<td valign="top">Fun and colorful image.  Sharpness is excellent and the subject is well placed withing the frame. Good luck!</td>', 'Fun and colorful image.  Sharpness is excellent and the subject is well placed withing the frame. Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570851, 208619, 22537, '<td valign="top">Striking.  One ofmy top picks for sure!</td>', 'Striking.  One ofmy top picks for sure!', '2005-07-28 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570858, 208439, 22537, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot. Though I''m not a "hater" of frames, this franme is a bit too heavy for the minimalistic tone of this shot.  It really could have stood out without the distraction of all the heaviness of the edge.  Good luck!</td>', 'What an amazing shot. Though I''m not a "hater" of frames, this franme is a bit too heavy for the minimalistic tone of this shot.  It really could have stood out without the distraction of all the heaviness of the edge.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570859, 206144, 22537, '<td valign="top">I love photos like this.  Simple, creative, clean, well toned and clever.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love photos like this.  Simple, creative, clean, well toned and clever.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570864, 207427, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is very clever and the use of some burning would have drawn out the grain much better.  Unfortunately, the top two pces seem washed out.  Goodluck!</td>', 'This is very clever and the use of some burning would have drawn out the grain much better.  Unfortunately, the top two pces seem washed out.  Goodluck!', '2005-07-28 23:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570868, 208666, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very clever and technically interetsing.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very clever and technically interetsing.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570872, 208080, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is striking and would have been suitably titled "flame".  I would like to see this re-edited as to soften the lighting on certain parts and bring out more texture. Good luck!</td>', 'This is striking and would have been suitably titled "flame".  I would like to see this re-edited as to soften the lighting on certain parts and bring out more texture. Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570877, 206345, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful!  You have managed to balance all of the elements needed to make this into a memorable image.  One of my top pick for a ribbon. Good luck!</td>', 'This is simply beautiful!  You have managed to balance all of the elements needed to make this into a memorable image.  One of my top pick for a ribbon. Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570879, 207627, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadow and an interesting subject.  Goodluck!</td>', 'Good use of shadow and an interesting subject.  Goodluck!', '2005-07-28 23:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570883, 208428, 22537, '<td valign="top">This shot has tons of captivating elements. I would love to photograph this setup but would compose it differently.  Good luck!</td>', 'This shot has tons of captivating elements. I would love to photograph this setup but would compose it differently.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570890, 208609, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is very very creative and the only thing that holds me back if the composition.  It is too.....boxy.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is very very creative and the only thing that holds me back if the composition.  It is too.....boxy.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570891, 207612, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done picture.  Nice lines and detail.   I love the dog...I just wish that I could see what he is looking at so intensely.</td>', 'Nicely done picture.  Nice lines and detail.   I love the dog...I just wish that I could see what he is looking at so intensely.', '2005-07-28 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570893, 208676, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Good use of DOF without losing the outline of the overall subject.  Goodluck!</td>', 'Great shot!  Good use of DOF without losing the outline of the overall subject.  Goodluck!', '2005-07-28 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570897, 206665, 22537, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but Teddy is likely getting hammered in overall scoring. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice shot but Teddy is likely getting hammered in overall scoring. Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570899, 208683, 22537, '<td valign="top">Oh my god!  I actually LIKE this cat photo.  Good luck!</td>', 'Oh my god!  I actually LIKE this cat photo.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570903, 208534, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  With the rocks in the background, the toothpicks remind me of a sea urchin.  Do you do that on purpose.  If so, great creativity.  Perfect lighting, focus and detail.  10</td>', 'Nicely done.  With the rocks in the background, the toothpicks remind me of a sea urchin.  Do you do that on purpose.  If so, great creativity.  Perfect lighting, focus and detail.  10', '2005-07-28 23:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570906, 207998, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great image and angle though it could have been edited to be a bit more dramatic.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great image and angle though it could have been edited to be a bit more dramatic.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570910, 207194, 3669, '<td valign="top">Pleasing composition, however, appears a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Pleasing composition, however, appears a little oversharpened.', '2005-07-28 23:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570912, 207677, 22537, '<td valign="top">Clever use of shadow.  Goodluck!</td>', 'Clever use of shadow.  Goodluck!', '2005-07-28 23:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570915, 207901, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo and angle.  Really could have used Neatimage to clean up the harsh noise.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very interesting photo and angle.  Really could have used Neatimage to clean up the harsh noise.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570916, 206274, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Great focus and detail.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Great focus and detail.', '2005-07-28 23:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570917, 206616, 22537, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!</td>', 'Brilliant!', '2005-07-28 23:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570919, 208199, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  Interesting perspective.', '2005-07-28 23:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570921, 208088, 22537, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570922, 206266, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very clean and good light.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very clean and good light.  Good luck!', '2005-07-28 23:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
