(1571658, 207427, 20667, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and nice picture. But somehow, the two shades of grey compete for my attention. And the lighter blocks of  wood somehow seem to hurt the eye...Maybe a less brighter shade would have been better? Just thinking aloud. :)</td>', 'Nice idea and nice picture. But somehow, the two shades of grey compete for my attention. And the lighter blocks of  wood somehow seem to hurt the eye...Maybe a less brighter shade would have been better? Just thinking aloud. :)', '2005-07-29 10:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
