(1571868, 206709, 31403, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t quite work for me, and I can''t put my finger on why.  Let me give some impressions - I *think* maybe a centered composition might work better - the top of the trellis parallel with the top of the frame, and the negative space on the sides equal triangles.  The wood is a wonderful color scheme, so the leaves have a chance to "pop" but they seem to be caught in the vingette or the dodge and burn.  So a litle more centered with the leaves really jumping out and less cyan in the blue and there''s my impression.  Hope my rambling helps  :)</td>', 'this doesn''t quite work for me, and I can''t put my finger on why.  Let me give some impressions - I *think* maybe a centered composition might work better - the top of the trellis parallel with the top of the frame, and the negative space on the sides equal triangles.  The wood is a wonderful color scheme, so the leaves have a chance to "pop" but they seem to be caught in the vingette or the dodge and burn.  So a litle more centered with the leaves really jumping out and less cyan in the blue and there''s my impression.  Hope my rambling helps  :)', '2005-07-29 13:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1571870, 208643, 31403, '<td valign="top">nice!  what''s not to love about it?  It''s not like you could *move* these guys around!  The blown sky and water stream are a little distracting, but very nicely done over all!</td>', 'nice!  what''s not to love about it?  It''s not like you could *move* these guys around!  The blown sky and water stream are a little distracting, but very nicely done over all!', '2005-07-29 13:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
