(1571874, 208015, 31403, '<td valign="top">I like to pull some cyan out of my skies that look like this, brings them back to blue, I use Hue/Sat to do it, but Selective Color will do it too - try it and see if it works for you.  The barn, and weeds are begging for dodge and burn treatments!  That would increase the contrast and strengthen this image IMHO.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'I like to pull some cyan out of my skies that look like this, brings them back to blue, I use Hue/Sat to do it, but Selective Color will do it too - try it and see if it works for you.  The barn, and weeds are begging for dodge and burn treatments!  That would increase the contrast and strengthen this image IMHO.  Hope that helps.', '2005-07-29 13:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
