(1574947, 208404, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-07-30 21:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574950, 208145, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The choice of background really hurts the shot. Lighting is too plain. Should have shot agianst a black background with more emotional lighting.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The choice of background really hurts the shot. Lighting is too plain. Should have shot agianst a black background with more emotional lighting.', '2005-07-30 21:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574953, 207794, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>There is some potential to where you shot this, but I disagree with the time of day and lighting angle. the checkered deck is too confusing, and there is really no good detail anywhere.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 There is some potential to where you shot this, but I disagree with the time of day and lighting angle. the checkered deck is too confusing, and there is really no good detail anywhere.', '2005-07-30 22:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574955, 208500, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>This is a great photo of an otherwise dull subject. Good use of lighting and isolation. It needs more sharpening IMHO.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 This is a great photo of an otherwise dull subject. Good use of lighting and isolation. It needs more sharpening IMHO.', '2005-07-30 22:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574957, 206274, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-07-30 22:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
