(1574961, 208199, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Perhaps a little more DOF. The border is distracting, and the denim material as well.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Perhaps a little more DOF. The border is distracting, and the denim material as well.', '2005-07-30 22:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574963, 208679, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-07-30 22:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574968, 208303, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very refreshing and creative approach to the challenge. A nice clean purposeful composition. A slight suggestion for improvement, maybe show more of the man''s face. There is such a great expression on the boy, so intense and focused on the job at hand, I think if you could see the man''s face as well would really help drive the story.</td>', 'A very refreshing and creative approach to the challenge. A nice clean purposeful composition. A slight suggestion for improvement, maybe show more of the man''s face. There is such a great expression on the boy, so intense and focused on the job at hand, I think if you could see the man''s face as well would really help drive the story.', '2005-07-30 22:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574977, 207372, 22734, '<td valign="top">Exquisite and direct. The lead, the wood and the paint all vie for attention and each offer their own visual reward. Very good.</td>', 'Exquisite and direct. The lead, the wood and the paint all vie for attention and each offer their own visual reward. Very good.', '2005-07-30 22:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574981, 208684, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely path is always so inviting.</td>', 'A lovely path is always so inviting.', '2005-07-30 22:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574984, 208654, 22734, '<td valign="top">This tree may need a bra. lol very nice wood texture.</td>', 'This tree may need a bra. lol very nice wood texture.', '2005-07-30 22:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574985, 208546, 22734, '<td valign="top">The sweet dulcimer.</td>', 'The sweet dulcimer.', '2005-07-30 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574991, 208180, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good subject, fits the challenge well. Composed nicely. Don''t know if it''s just the focus or your chosen dof, but it seems a little off. Also something feels unnatural and oddly unsettling about the image. The grass towards the back, and the framing in the back look quite bright, and the white buildings in the background are very bright, appear blown out actually. But the foreground and especially the sky just doesn''t seem to correlate with that. Can''t tell if it''s in the editing, or if the shot was taken close to dark with bright lights in the area or what, but very unsettling.</td>', 'A good subject, fits the challenge well. Composed nicely. Don''t know if it''s just the focus or your chosen dof, but it seems a little off. Also something feels unnatural and oddly unsettling about the image. The grass towards the back, and the framing in the back look quite bright, and the white buildings in the background are very bright, appear blown out actually. But the foreground and especially the sky just doesn''t seem to correlate with that. Can''t tell if it''s in the editing, or if the shot was taken close to dark with bright lights in the area or what, but very unsettling.', '2005-07-30 22:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574993, 206144, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice poignant study with a subdued invitation to attract the eyes and concentrate on the universal topic of wood. The composition offers such a wonderful background and as mellow as wood itself.</td>', 'A very nice poignant study with a subdued invitation to attract the eyes and concentrate on the universal topic of wood. The composition offers such a wonderful background and as mellow as wood itself.', '2005-07-30 22:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574995, 208153, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good dubject for this challenge.</td>', 'A very good dubject for this challenge.', '2005-07-30 22:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574996, 207791, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely and so inviting. What a find!</td>', 'Lovely and so inviting. What a find!', '2005-07-30 22:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1574999, 208028, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great old time look. You even captured the character of the time.</td>', 'Great old time look. You even captured the character of the time.', '2005-07-30 22:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575000, 208619, 22734, '<td valign="top">A captivating image that radiates charm.</td>', 'A captivating image that radiates charm.', '2005-07-30 22:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575004, 208630, 22734, '<td valign="top">That''s wood. Good action capture with cooperative subjects.</td>', 'That''s wood. Good action capture with cooperative subjects.', '2005-07-30 22:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575035, 207995, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good subject. Fits the challenge, although I think in this particular challenge, a stronger connection might be made if more of the actual wooden body were showing, here the attention is drawn strongly to the parts, especially the bridge, which is of course metal. Lighting is not bad, there are no unwanted heavy shadows or bright/hot spots, although I think maybe a little tweaking in editing (levels or curves adj. and maybe some brightness/contrast) could enhance the presentation. Compositionally, although dramatic angles and perspectives can be great, I feel that this straight on approach works and has a good interest level. However, it seems that the specific framing/cropping takes a little away from the image though, due to the parts being cut off (the pickup, knife switch, tone knob and jack plug). It''s like when you view a photo of people and a head, or arm or leg is cutoff in the frame, unless it is obviously purposeful for that composition, it comes off as accidental and unsettling. It does seem that you have a good eye and feel, and chose a good subject. A little attention to detail can make a ''good'' photo ''great''.   :-)</td>', 'A good subject. Fits the challenge, although I think in this particular challenge, a stronger connection might be made if more of the actual wooden body were showing, here the attention is drawn strongly to the parts, especially the bridge, which is of course metal. Lighting is not bad, there are no unwanted heavy shadows or bright/hot spots, although I think maybe a little tweaking in editing (levels or curves adj. and maybe some brightness/contrast) could enhance the presentation. Compositionally, although dramatic angles and perspectives can be great, I feel that this straight on approach works and has a good interest level. However, it seems that the specific framing/cropping takes a little away from the image though, due to the parts being cut off (the pickup, knife switch, tone knob and jack plug). It''s like when you view a photo of people and a head, or arm or leg is cutoff in the frame, unless it is obviously purposeful for that composition, it comes off as accidental and unsettling. It does seem that you have a good eye and feel, and chose a good subject. A little attention to detail can make a ''good'' photo ''great''.   :-)', '2005-07-30 23:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575065, 208132, 8624, '<td valign="top">good repeating patterns in the trusses. somewhat overexposed at the end of the tunnel.</td>', 'good repeating patterns in the trusses. somewhat overexposed at the end of the tunnel.', '2005-07-30 23:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575066, 208124, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice tones. the sepia works well here.</td>', 'nice tones. the sepia works well here.', '2005-07-30 23:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575068, 208621, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice bright saturated colors.</td>', 'nice bright saturated colors.', '2005-07-30 23:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575072, 208630, 38032, '<td valign="top">This has a good vybe that I like - - dare I say ''fun''.  But for For some reason this photo would seem more original if there were no humans in it.  I like this time of day for the shadows and colored cast to the image -  I think the familiarity of this type of image  makes it seem like just a snap-type shot - which isn''t necessarilly bad!  7</td>', 'This has a good vybe that I like - - dare I say ''fun''.  But for For some reason this photo would seem more original if there were no humans in it.  I like this time of day for the shadows and colored cast to the image -  I think the familiarity of this type of image  makes it seem like just a snap-type shot - which isn''t necessarilly bad!  7', '2005-07-30 23:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575086, 206345, 8624, '<td valign="top">cool lighting and point of view. maybe a bit too heavy on the noise reduction?</td>', 'cool lighting and point of view. maybe a bit too heavy on the noise reduction?', '2005-07-30 23:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575090, 208596, 25355, '<td valign="top">I always thought she was in a rocking chair...</td>', 'I always thought she was in a rocking chair...', '2005-07-30 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575111, 207998, 37961, '<td valign="top">I need some of those rocks for my fish tank.....Interesting perspective.</td>', 'I need some of those rocks for my fish tank.....Interesting perspective.', '2005-07-31 00:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575114, 205721, 37961, '<td valign="top">Very different approach. I like it.</td>', 'Very different approach. I like it.', '2005-07-31 00:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575341, 208637, 3669, '<td valign="top">Photo is technically well done.  Good DOF, focus, lighting and such.  The background has nice green colors.  Definately fits the challenge.  The only thing that I''m counting down for is that a picture a wooden shark just doesn''t interest me very much.  5</td>', 'Photo is technically well done.  Good DOF, focus, lighting and such.  The background has nice green colors.  Definately fits the challenge.  The only thing that I''m counting down for is that a picture a wooden shark just doesn''t interest me very much.  5', '2005-07-31 03:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575344, 208180, 3669, '<td valign="top">I don''t much care for the lighting in this picture...perhaps maybe too much contrast?  Also it has a lot of artifact in it and OOF.  Perhaps getting closer to your subject and just taking part of the frame would be more interesting.</td>', 'I don''t much care for the lighting in this picture...perhaps maybe too much contrast?  Also it has a lot of artifact in it and OOF.  Perhaps getting closer to your subject and just taking part of the frame would be more interesting.', '2005-07-31 03:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575346, 208390, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''m having more fun looking at the live cat then anything else in the picture.  What an elegant pose.</td>', 'I''m having more fun looking at the live cat then anything else in the picture.  What an elegant pose.', '2005-07-31 03:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575350, 208145, 3669, '<td valign="top">I find that the worn wooden flooring background is more interesting than the subject.  Lighting is a little harsh on the owl.</td>', 'I find that the worn wooden flooring background is more interesting than the subject.  Lighting is a little harsh on the owl.', '2005-07-31 03:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575356, 207751, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on common household items.  Nice take on the challenge.  Technically the picture is well done.  I like the blue background.</td>', 'Interesting perspective on common household items.  Nice take on the challenge.  Technically the picture is well done.  I like the blue background.', '2005-07-31 03:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575401, 207290, 16046, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2005-07-31 04:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575439, 208439, 37252, '<td valign="top">the frame is much too thick - would be a really nice photo with a thinner frame.</td>', 'the frame is much too thick - would be a really nice photo with a thinner frame.', '2005-07-31 06:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575440, 208124, 37252, '<td valign="top">there is a gray blob to the right of the chimney. Looks like you tried to burn out  a distraction but created a bigger one. A  real shame as it ruins an otherwise nice photo.</td>', 'there is a gray blob to the right of the chimney. Looks like you tried to burn out  a distraction but created a bigger one. A  real shame as it ruins an otherwise nice photo.', '2005-07-31 06:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575442, 208366, 37252, '<td valign="top">much too over-processed in my mind</td>', 'much too over-processed in my mind', '2005-07-31 06:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575591, 207677, 41093, '<td valign="top">Good Shot!!!  Presents a point of view, in a particular form.  The sharpen area invites us to look ahead for more.</td>', 'Good Shot!!!  Presents a point of view, in a particular form.  The sharpen area invites us to look ahead for more.', '2005-07-31 11:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1575770, 208654, 32997, '<td valign="top">Like the shape, and the background is handled well here.</td>', 'Like the shape, and the background is handled well here.', '2005-07-31 12:55:17.000000', NULL, 1);
