(1575931, 208447, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I''m definitely drawn to the mountain rather than the hut...Ithink this is partly a lighting problem and also the rather false looking roof colour (it may have been this colour but reds have a tendency to dominate any shot).</td>', 'Great shot but I''m definitely drawn to the mountain rather than the hut...Ithink this is partly a lighting problem and also the rather false looking roof colour (it may have been this colour but reds have a tendency to dominate any shot).', '2005-07-31 14:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
