(1576063, 208439, 23053, '<td valign="top">They must''ve been running a special on borders that day.  Wow.  <br/> <br/>Anyway, I like the shot.  The two cranes are a good capper to the image, and it almost seems as though some of the cypress knees and branches are talking to each other, too.  All in all, I think this is a good shot, but that border blows my mind (and really, I normally don''t mind borders).</td>', 'They must''ve been running a special on borders that day.  Wow.   Anyway, I like the shot.  The two cranes are a good capper to the image, and it almost seems as though some of the cypress knees and branches are talking to each other, too.  All in all, I think this is a good shot, but that border blows my mind (and really, I normally don''t mind borders).', '2005-07-31 16:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
