(1577366, 208022, 36235, '<td valign="top">Wow...a top 20 finish.  I am stunned.  When I first signed up on this site as a novice photographer I thought it would take forever to get a photo into the top 20.  Most of what Ive learned about photography (especially post-processing) has come from hours and hours of studying the material on this site, so I owe a big thank you to the DPC community.<br/> <br/>Ive included all the post-processing steps I did in my comments on the photo.  Ive also uploaded a photo of the setup I used to get the shot:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=211935" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=211935</a> <br/> <br/>Thanks so much to all for the great comments, and thanks again DPC!</td>', 'Wow...a top 20 finish.  I am stunned.  When I first signed up on this site as a novice photographer I thought it would take forever to get a photo into the top 20.  Most of what Ive learned about photography (especially post-processing) has come from hours and hours of studying the material on this site, so I owe a big thank you to the DPC community. Ive included all the post-processing steps I did in my comments on the photo.  Ive also uploaded a photo of the setup I used to get the shot://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=211935  Thanks so much to all for the great comments, and thanks again DPC!', '2005-08-01 02:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
