(1585532, 207290, 14986, '<td valign="top">The king of the fog machine!  I really like this shot.  I''m not sure I would say there''s a strong connection to the challenge topic, but it works.  Very moody, very spooky.  The lighting and the pose are perfect.  I think it would have been even better to have some water with reflections at the bottom of the pic.</td>', 'The king of the fog machine!  I really like this shot.  I''m not sure I would say there''s a strong connection to the challenge topic, but it works.  Very moody, very spooky.  The lighting and the pose are perfect.  I think it would have been even better to have some water with reflections at the bottom of the pic.', '2005-08-03 23:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
