(1586087, 207149, 14614, '<td valign="top">Photo works because of the bottom (respectfully disagree with a few comments) as it provides the needed perspective (without it few would have seen the challenge connection)<br/> <br/>Greens pop in the light -- shadow on lower trees disturbs my eye but adds a creative element that breaks up the composition.  Like the border and the crop.  Scored it a 5 (only because I took a couple of points off because a limited fit with the challenge -- I felt more leaves than wooden)</td>', 'Photo works because of the bottom (respectfully disagree with a few comments) as it provides the needed perspective (without it few would have seen the challenge connection) Greens pop in the light -- shadow on lower trees disturbs my eye but adds a creative element that breaks up the composition.  Like the border and the crop.  Scored it a 5 (only because I took a couple of points off because a limited fit with the challenge -- I felt more leaves than wooden)', '2005-08-04 08:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
