(1586818, 208619, 41817, '<td valign="top">To me art must evoke an emotional response.  Large or small, happy or sad.  I get such a response from Fairyland.  Nice shot, good burn/vinyetting.  Very framable.  Cute?  A little formidable maybe, almost a witch''s hovel.  I almost expect the hut to ''breathe''.</td>', 'To me art must evoke an emotional response.  Large or small, happy or sad.  I get such a response from Fairyland.  Nice shot, good burn/vinyetting.  Very framable.  Cute?  A little formidable maybe, almost a witch''s hovel.  I almost expect the hut to ''breathe''.', '2005-08-04 14:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
