(2318387, 206345, 36470, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is overdone at all.  The first word that came to mind was surreal and then I read your description and that is what you were after.  The only distracting element, IMO, is the bottom part of the gazebo is hidden by the foreground.  I would have given this a 9 :)</td>', 'I don''t think this is overdone at all.  The first word that came to mind was surreal and then I read your description and that is what you were after.  The only distracting element, IMO, is the bottom part of the gazebo is hidden by the foreground.  I would have given this a 9 :)', '2006-04-17 09:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
