(5225671, 208560, 30807, '<td valign="top">A choice photo - very much together. He looks like that was a sour note, or he had been dating the bride and she dumped him - like the sepia treatment, and the rich color of the cello, contrasting somehow with the creation behind him - one a divine one, the other inspired music inspired by divine promptings? Very nice combination - it could be he had a touch of indigestion, or a late night<br/> <br/>I like the differential focus too-concentrates on him<br/> <br/>Very nice, as are so many of your shots, and the border is the finishing touch here<br/> <br/>keep clicking!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-29 05:14:56.</i></td>', 'A choice photo - very much together. He looks like that was a sour note, or he had been dating the bride and she dumped him - like the sepia treatment, and the rich color of the cello, contrasting somehow with the creation behind him - one a divine one, the other inspired music inspired by divine promptings? Very nice combination - it could be he had a touch of indigestion, or a late night I like the differential focus too-concentrates on him Very nice, as are so many of your shots, and the border is the finishing touch here keep clicking!', '2009-01-29 05:14:16.000000', '2009-01-29 05:14:56.000000', 0),
