(6116273, 208621, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is pretty nice here.  Good contrasting colors.  Nice subject.  One common thing I''ve noticed as I leave these comments on different people is that people tend to not let their subjects breathe with enough negative space.  This looks cramped on the right and top and possibly even the bottom.</td>', 'I think the composition is pretty nice here.  Good contrasting colors.  Nice subject.  One common thing I''ve noticed as I leave these comments on different people is that people tend to not let their subjects breathe with enough negative space.  This looks cramped on the right and top and possibly even the bottom.', '2010-08-03 23:04:47.000000', NULL, 0),
